---
description: Change control for the deterministic policy engine
globs: packages/policy/**
---
This package is the product's guardrail. Rules:
- Pure functions only. No imports from apps/*, no fetch, no Prisma, no LLM SDKs, no Date.now().
- Check order is fixed (FR-11 / PRD §6.2). Do not reorder checks.
- Every reason code has a dedicated test that trips it and one boundary test where applicable.
- Coverage must remain 100% branches. Run `pnpm test --filter @mandate/policy -- --coverage` and paste the summary.
- Do not add configuration flags that bypass a check.
- Any change to evaluate()'s signature requires updating PRD.md §6.2 first (do not silently edit the PRD) and saying so.
